That device you have there...
It’s a PokéNav.{be01}
When Trainers that have PokéNavs
battle, it keeps a record of how{be00}
things went, I think.{be01}
Oh, pardon me.
My name is Steven.{be01}
I’m interested in rare stones, so
I travel here and there.{be01}
Oh?
A Letter for me?

Steven: Okay, thank you.{be01}
You went through all this trouble to
deliver that. I need to thank you.{be01}
Let me see...
I’ll give you this TM.{be01}
It contains my favorite move,
Steel Wing.

大吾：你的宝可梦看起来培养得很不
错。继续努力的话，也许有一天能成{be01}
为宝可梦联盟的冠军呢。我是这么想
的喔。对了！既然有缘相识，就在宝{be01}
可导航里互相登录一下吧。…… …… ……
